
Updates to the game in 2025.

==December (12) 2025==
===Maintenance Break (22/12/2025)===
*{{Balance|Buff}}Summoning a [[Heroes|Hero]] with 200 Hero Fragments will always grant you a Hero that you don't have yet (as opposed to having a chance to get a duplicate Hero).
*{{Balance|Neutral}}Having all Heroes during a Hero summon will grant you 20 Hero Fragments and some card copies of that Hero.
*{{Balance|Add}}[[Mini P.E.K.K.A./Hero|Hero Mini P.E.K.K.A.]] added to the roster of summonable Heroes.
*{{Balance|Remove}}Only 1 Hero slot is available in Classic 1v1s, Classic 2v2s, Classic Challenges, and Grand Challenges.

===Balance Changes (12/12/2025)===
'''[[Cards|Card]] Balancing'''
*{{Balance|Nerf|Hero}}[[Knight/Hero|Knight]]: Triumphant Taunt Duration decreased to 4 seconds (from 5 seconds).
*{{Balance|Add}}[[Monk]]: immune to any knockback.
'''Bug Fixes'''
*{{Balance|Neutral}}[[Goblin Demolisher]]: No longer chases Hero Knight during Triumphant Taunt after less than 50% Hitpoints.

