===Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)===
*{{Balance|Add}} [[Experience|Level]] 16 has been added.
*{{Balance|Neutral}}All [[Magic Items#Wild Card|Wild Cards]], [[Magic Items#Magic Coin|Magic Coins]], [[Magic Items#Book of Books|Books of Cards]], and [[Magic Items#Book of Books|Books of Books]] were converted into [[Gems]], [[Gold]], and Wild Cards of the Book's rarity.
*{{Balance|Temp}} [[Ranked]] level-capped at level 15 until May 2026.
*{{Balance|Neutral}}[[Arenas#Trophy Road|Trophy Road]] rewards tweaked.
*{{Balance|Buff}}[[Card Evolution|Evolution]] slots moved to Arena 3 and 10, added [[Heroes|Hero]]/[[:Category:Champion Cards|Champion]] slots to Arena 15 and 24.
*{{Balance|Neutral}}[[Gold]] and copy requirement for [[Cards]] modified at level 13 and 14.
*{{Balance|Add}}[[Magic Items#Crystal|Crystals]] and the Crystal Market added.
*{{Balance|Add}}[[Pass Royale]] now changes at Arena 15, evolving into a Hero Pass Royale. All tiers had their rewards tweaked.
*{{Balance|Add}}Added deck slots exclusive to {{Rarity|Champion}} cards.
*{{Balance|Add}} New visual effects for a lot of [[cards]]. More specifically:
**{{Balance|Add}} Certain attacks ([[Night Witch]], [[Lumberjack]], and [[Golden Knight]]) get new slicing attacks (Night Witch had her previous attack effect substituted).
**{{Balance|Add}} Explosions ([[Fireball]], [[Bomber]], [[Bomb Tower]], [[Balloon]], [[Giant Skeleton]], and [[Goblin Demolisher]]) have new effects.
**{{Balance|Add}} Fire ([[Skeleton Dragons]], [[Wizard]], and [[Baby Dragon]]) has new fireball and splash effects.
**{{Balance|Add}} Lightning ([[Electro Wizard]] [[Zappies]], [[Electro Wizard]], and [[Electro Dragon]]) has a new effect.
**{{Balance|Add}} Shields ([[Guards]], [[Royal Recruits]], and [[Dark Prince]]) have a smaller health bar above the troop's main health bar.
**{{Balance|Add}} [[Witch]]'s orb and splash are cleaner.
**{{Balance|Add}} [[Princess]]' arrows are no longer in flames when still on her bow, arrows disappear quicker after hitting the ground.
**{{Balance|Add}} [[Electro Giant]] has a blue Zap Pack range.
**{{Balance|Add}} [[Bandit]] has a new effect after hitting a target with her dash.
**{{Balance|Add}} [[Goblin Machine]] has a different rocket lock-in animation.
**{{Balance|Add}} [[Skeleton King]] has dark-green visual effects when summoning [[Skeletons]].
**{{Balance|Add}} [[Golden Knight]] has a slight golden flash when hitting a target with Dashing Dash and has new different poses when dashing to targets.
**{{Balance|Add}} Evolutions have a new deployment visual effect to match with the newer Evolution releases.
***{{Balance|Add}} Shield Visuals ([[Knight/Evolution|Evolved Knight]] and [[Wizard/Evolution|Evolved Wizard]]) have been changed to a dark purple shield.
***{{Balance|Add}} Lightning ([[Tesla/Evolution|Evolved Tesla]] and [[Electro Dragon/Evolution|Evolved Electro Dragon]]) is now purple.
***{{Balance|Add}} Explosions ([[Bomber/Evolution|Evolved Bomber]], [[Cannon/Evolution|Evolved Cannon]], and [[Wall Breakers/Evolution|Evolved Wall Breakers]]) have purplish fire explosions. They also have purplish fire on the tip of their bomb/dynamites.
***{{Balance|Add}} Shields (Evolved Wizard and [[Skeleton Army/Evolution|Evolved Skeleton Army]]) have a smaller health bar above the troop's main health bar.
***{{Balance|Add}} [[Goblin Cage/Evolution|Evolved Goblin Cage]] now causes a purple smoke when the hand leaves the cage, grabs a troop, and attacks the grabbed troop.
***{{Balance|Add}} [[Valkyrie/Evolution|Evolved Valkyrie]]'s whirlwind is a clearer and cleaner purple.
***{{Balance|Add}} [[Battle Ram/Evolution|Evolved Battle Ram]] leaves a purple smoke when charging and when hitting its first troop.
***{{Balance|Add}} Evolved Wizard's fireball and splash are a purplish color.
***{{Balance|Add}} [[Tesla/Evolution|Evolved Tesla]]'s pulses are now a clearer purple color.
***{{Balance|Add}} [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Evolved Mega Knight]]'s jump now causes a small purple earthquake.
***{{Balance|Add}} [[Goblin Drill/Evolution|Evolved Goblin Drill]]'s submerge trail is now a darker purple and spawns alongside a purple smoke.
*{{Balance|Add}} [[Monk]] is no longer immune to the knockback effects of Evolved Mega Knight and another Monk. He is also no longer immune to [[Fireball]] and [[Giant Snowball]]'s knockbacks if those spells hit the Monk on the corner of their Area of EFfect.

